<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank has no comment on zloty intervention.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank has no comment on zloty intervention.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) declined to comment on its forex market interventions on Monday, the deputy NBP president's office said.</p>
<p>Dealers estimated that today the central bank bought an estimated $80 million worth of dollars and marks combined through repeated interventions, its first on the forex market since May 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
